          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "*10. Use the connection you found to find the coordinates of B given that M (–7, 1) is the midpoint of A (3, – 4) and B (x, y)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
